<div class="container">
    <header>
        <h1>👥 User Management</h1>
        <p>Authentication and user account endpoints</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content">
        <div class="card">
            <h2>🔐 Authentication Endpoints</h2>
            <p style="color: oklch(0.65 0 0); margin-bottom: 20px;">
                These endpoints handle user registration, login, and session management.
            </p>

            <h3>Public Endpoints</h3>
            <ul class="endpoint-list">
                <li>
                    <span class="method post">POST</span>
                    <span class="path">/api/auth/register</span>
                    <span class="description">Create a new user account</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="method post">POST</span>
                    <span class="path">/api/auth/login</span>
                    <span class="description">Authenticate user and receive JWT token</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="method post">POST</span>
                    <span class="path">/api/auth/refresh</span>
                    <span class="description">Refresh expired JWT token</span>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Protected Endpoints</h3>
            <ul class="endpoint-list">
                <li>
                    <span class="method get">GET</span>
                    <span class="path">/api/auth/profile</span>
                    <span class="description">Get current user profile (requires authentication)</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>📋 Registration Request</h2>
            <p style="color: oklch(0.65 0 0); margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <strong>Endpoint:</strong> <code>POST /api/auth/register</code>
            </p>

            <div style="background: oklch(0.08 0 0 / 0.5); border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 12px; color: oklch(0.85 0 0); font-weight: 600;">Request Body:</h3>
                <pre><code>{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "name": "John Doe"
}</code></pre>
            </div>

            <div style="background: oklch(0.08 0 0 / 0.5); border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 0.75rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 12px; color: oklch(0.85 0 0); font-weight: 600;">Response (201 Created):</h3>
                <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "message": "User registered successfully",
  "user": {
    "id": "uuid-here",
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "plan": "free"
  },
  "token": "jwt-token-here"
}</code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🔑 Login Request</h2>
            <p style="color: oklch(0.65 0 0); margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <strong>Endpoint:</strong> <code>POST /api/auth/login</code>
            </p>

            <div style="background: oklch(0.08 0 0 / 0.5); border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 12px; color: oklch(0.85 0 0); font-weight: 600;">Request Body:</h3>
                <pre><code>{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}</code></pre>
            </div>

            <div style="background: oklch(0.08 0 0 / 0.5); border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 0.75rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 12px; color: oklch(0.85 0 0); font-weight: 600;">Response (200 OK):</h3>
                <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "user": {
    "id": "uuid-here",
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "plan": "free",
    "conversions_used": 0,
    "conversions_limit": 3
  },
  "token": "jwt-token-here"
}</code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>👤 Get Profile Request</h2>
            <p style="color: oklch(0.65 0 0); margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <strong>Endpoint:</strong> <code>GET /api/auth/profile</code><br>
                <strong>Authentication:</strong> Required (Bearer token)
            </p>

            <div style="background: oklch(0.08 0 0 / 0.5); border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 12px; color: oklch(0.85 0 0); font-weight: 600;">Request Headers:</h3>
                <pre><code>Authorization: Bearer jwt-token-here</code></pre>
            </div>

            <div style="background: oklch(0.08 0 0 / 0.5); border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 0.75rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 12px; color: oklch(0.85 0 0); font-weight: 600;">Response (200 OK):</h3>
                <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "user": {
    "id": "uuid-here",
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "plan": "free",
    "conversions_used": 0,
    "conversions_limit": 3,
    "subscription_status": null,
    "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:00:00.000Z"
  }
}</code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🔄 Refresh Token Request</h2>
            <p style="color: oklch(0.65 0 0); margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <strong>Endpoint:</strong> <code>POST /api/auth/refresh</code>
            </p>

            <div style="background: oklch(0.08 0 0 / 0.5); border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 12px; color: oklch(0.85 0 0); font-weight: 600;">Request Body:</h3>
                <pre><code>{
  "refreshToken": "refresh-token-here"
}</code></pre>
            </div>

            <div style="background: oklch(0.08 0 0 / 0.5); border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 0.75rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 12px; color: oklch(0.85 0 0); font-weight: 600;">Response (200 OK):</h3>
                <pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "token": "new-jwt-token-here"
}</code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>💡 Authentication Notes</h2>
            <ul style="list-style-position: inside; color: oklch(0.75 0 0); line-height: 1.8;">
                <li>Passwords are hashed with bcrypt (salt rounds: 10)</li>
                <li>JWT tokens expire after 7 days by default</li>
                <li>All authentication endpoints have rate limiting (5 requests per 15 minutes)</li>
                <li>User emails must be unique</li>
                <li>Default plan for new users is "free" with 3 conversions per month</li>
                <li>Session tokens are stored in localStorage on the frontend</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🔗 Quick Links</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8;">
                <a href="/">← Back to Home</a><br>
                <a href="/health">🏥 System Health</a><br>
                <a href="/api/payfast/plans">💳 Pricing Plans</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>PDFLab API v1.0.0 | Secure Authentication</p>
    </footer>
</div>
